# Empirica toolchain prewarm (2026-08-20). Captured from a running container
# (~285MB: Volta 2.0.2 + node 24.19.0 + empirica release binaries) so the
# image builds offline-deterministic. Regenerate from a healthy container:
#   docker exec delibra-empirica tar -czf /tmp/pw.tgz \
#     -C /home/delibra/.local/share/empirica volta   # + /home/delibra/.cache empirica
# then extract both into infra/prewarm/. Never commit — it's a binary cache.
infra/prewarm/
